msgid "Download all albums and all non-album assets into <OUTPUT_FOLDER>. - Albums are downloaded under <OUTPUT_FOLDER>/Albums/<AlbumName> (flattened). - Non-album assets go into <OUTPUT_FOLDER>/<NO_ALBUMS_FOLDER>/ with year/month structure. Example: --download-all ./MyLibrary"
